# Copy source of truth: franklinforsupervisor.com

- **Default**: All user-facing text (headlines, subheads, section copy, CTA labels, meta descriptions) should **match the exact wording** on `franklinforsupervisor.com`.
- **When changing copy**: Pull the current live copy first and mirror it exactly (including punctuation, capitalization, and apostrophes).
- **Overrides**: Only diverge from the live site copy when the user **explicitly** requests different text or says not to match.
- **Consistency**: If the same line appears in multiple places, keep it identical everywhere unless the user asks for variation.

